# Plex.rbf provenance ledger (JSON Lines), appended by scripts/build_rbf_remote.sh.
# One entry per fitted bitstream: md5/sha256 of the RBF plus the BUILD_ID baked
# into its CONF_STR V entry. scripts/rbf_provenance.py resolves an md5 found on a
# device back to the source that produced it; an md5 that is absent here is
# reported as an untraceable bitstream and fails, by design.
